## Building

### Requirements

- Rust (latest stable)
- PostgreSQL development headers
- pgrx development environment initialized via `cargo pgrx init`

### Compilation

```bash
cd {name}
cargo pgrx build
```

## Installation

### Quick Install

```bash
cargo pgrx install
```

This will compile the extension and install it into a pgrx-managed PostgreSQL instance.

### Production Install

For production deployments:

```bash
cargo pgrx package
```

Then follow the standard PostgreSQL extension installation procedures.

## Usage

```sql
